  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In an April 21, 2026 press briefing, Hurst said generative AI is a “game changer” for reconciling data and could change how the department approaches its audit. In the same briefing, he said the budget’s presidential priorities category includes AI and data infrastructure and that there is a large chunk for AI and data infrastructure. In a 2021 article, Hurst wrote that AI/ML technologies offer defense leaders tools to attack longstanding problems but are not solutions in themselves.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s4",
    "s3"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "In an April 21, 2026 press briefing, Hurst said generative AI is a “game changer” for reconciling data and could change how the department approaches its audit.",
